      "fine_trace_step": 5,
      "description": "This assignment stores the wide destination width into `spec->n_bits`, whose vulnerable type is `uint8_t` in `include/openvswitch/ofp-actions.h`. The narrowing truncates the length later used to step across immediate data. The fix widens `n_bits` to `uint32_t`."
    },
