      "fine_trace_step": 9,
      "description": "The forged interior spec created from the first immediate payload passes a bogus `struct mf_subfield` into `mf_check__`. Evaluating `sf->field->n_bits` dereferences its non-null invalid `field` pointer and triggers the observed MemorySanitizer SEGV on READ."
